    markdown: "The annual probability of such an earthquake is $p=0.04$. For a Bernoulli process, the expected (average) time between successive occurrences is the reciprocal:\n\n$$T = \\frac{1}{p} = \\frac{1}{0.04} = 25 \\text{ years}.$$\n\nTherefore, the answer is $25$.",
