    markdown: "Given: Som is younger than Riaz; Shiv is elder than Ansu; Ansu is the youngest.\n\n- Statement 1: Shiv is younger than Riaz. Combined with the givens, Riaz is older than both Shiv and Som, and Ansu is the youngest, so **Riaz is the eldest**. Statement 1 alone suffices.\n- Statement 2: Shiv is elder than Som. This still leaves Riaz vs. Shiv unresolved, so the eldest cannot be determined.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is **Option A (Statement 1 by itself determines the eldest child.)**.",
